"<strong>Sales App</strong>: Sell treatment packages, gift cards, and retail products with clear quotations\n"
"              and pricing."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Salgsapp</strong>: Tilbyd behandlingspakker, gavekort og "
"detailprodukter med gennemsigtige priser\n"
"              og attraktive tilbud."

